    "gp_section_633608083016319862": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "1ba99c468802936e89a9dbb528b316f09b5ea34995337ed167191305383e1615_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-jCH9Fxdt_text": "<p><strong>L Saunders</strong></p>",
        "gg4kF6AQB2O_text": "<p>I got all my pictures, screenshots and downloads off my phone, tablet and laptop. What a relief. I have had several phones die over the years and so much info was on them. I don't trust drop box or just saving photos on a device, google took ALL of mine and I have no idea where they are. This photo stick is worth every penny.</p>",
        "gg5v_NobzxQ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/verified-icon-1633012010543.png?v=1633012010",
        "gg7kTcYqycT_text": "<p>This SO easy to work with. Simply pug it in, load the small app, and click. Sit back have a coffee or two. (If you are picture hoarder like me a short nap is good) I don't mean to imply it is slow I had a lot of pics.</p>",
        "ggAcTZ2Snpx_text": "<p><i><strong>Love it!!! PhotoStick is a great Gift&nbsp;</strong></i></p>",
        "ggAiWRe5n1i_text": "<p><strong>Sharon P.</strong></p>",
        "ggAxwlBcWVM_text": "<p><strong>Kathleen M.</strong></p>",
        "ggF8varAIC__text": "<p><strong>VERIFIED BUYER</strong></p>",
        "ggHzLA83Ps-_text": "<p><i><strong>Save with photostick before your device fails</strong></i></p>",
        "ggJc55dH4Km_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/verified-icon-1633012010543.png?v=1633012010",
        "ggMRpZ10727_text": "<p><i><strong>Picture Stick is a gift for anyone!&nbsp;</strong></i></p>",
        "ggMuNzHQsCN_text": "<p><strong>VERIFIED BUYER</strong></p>",
        "ggN3WDZ71NM_text": "<p><i><strong>If you've never used one try it best thing ever&nbsp;</strong></i></p>",
        "ggR9xpU5gc1_text": "<p><strong>Photo stick that's worth buying</strong></p>",
        "ggWC04PgUsl_text": "<p><strong>VERIFIED BUYER</strong></p>",
        "ggWbAqxWxYe_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/verified-icon-1633012010543.png?v=1633012010",
        "ggWrePGp-kb_text": "<p><strong>Billy D. Gatton</strong></p>",
        "ggY_1_pspfV_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/verified-icon-1633012010543.png?v=1633012010",
        "ggbOvfRjfXi_text": "Don't just take our word for it! Find out what other users are saying:",
        "ggfZz4l9UOZ_text": "<p>It's easy to use and it searched my computer for pictures and videos. This is so worth getting. It's 128gb and it also has a cover.</p>",
        "ggfu4zLOub3_text": "<p>Love it!! I had 2,500 photos on my iPhone and doubles. The stick in less than 3 minutes downloaded and deleted doubles. Now my phone is freed up and 2,000 originals are on the stick 😃. Great gift idea for Christmas 🎄 Thanks also for the support of staff in answering emails so quickly.</p>",
        "ggmJUsS88Qb_text": "<strong>★ Over 6,000+ Reviews ★</strong>",
        "ggpoAbDG7FT_text": "<p><strong>VERIFIED BUYER</strong></p>",
        "ggqnF-by2h__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/verified-icon-1633012010543.png?v=1633012010",
        "gguf688T9Pp_text": "<p>Love it love it love it One of the best things I have ever bought to put pictures on I have almost 4000 pictures on in and still have Room to add more easy to work easy to use. Such a great thing to have.</p>",
        "ggws_DgYpOq_text": "<p><strong>VERIFIED BUYER</strong></p>",
        "ggxXMRL3e1b_text": "<p><strong>Roslynn Shirley</strong></p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-633608083016319862"
    },
